# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day19

I remember when I was going to meet one of my friends in another part of the city.

I was taking the subway, but I accidentally got on the wrong train.

The problem was that I didn't realize my mistake until I had traveled several stops.

I checked the map on my phone and got off at the next station.

Fortunately, I was able to find the correct train and eventually arrived at the meeting place.

I was a little embarrassed and stressed at first, but my friend understood the situation.

In the end, everything worked out fine, and now I always double-check the train direction before I get on.
